{"kind": "source", "path": "/Users/sen/.codex/visualizations/2026/10/02/01a0fa9f-302c-7d10-84dc-b53005a89c65/book-readable-zh-pilot-20261019/source/enchiridion.md", "sha256": "ff99d1ff523d92f5c90a95ac78ebb74571d6be605c1caac2d049acdd30f84cfa", "bytes": 34230, "repo": "goocarlos/enchiridion-zh", "commit": "c378a32636df490a993540a07bdb7a4f318ccec0", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "candidate_headings": 53}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "一", "para": 0, "chars": 37, "head": "世间万物，皆可一分为二。", "tail": "二，为我力所不能及之事。", "sha256": "e3668fc785bbc005b0ef7dffd641af4831027e702e655d143e7b5ae51e3bb763"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "一", "para": 1, "chars": 43, "head": "我力所能及者，是我们的判", "tail": "源于我们内在心智的活动。", "sha256": "42e251e06af7076076f428c9e7c457567c275655de7d50c41d72988859d59f4e"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "一", "para": 2, "chars": 45, "head": "我力所不能及者，是我们的", "tail": "源于我们内在心智的事物。", "sha256": "ed47f60c385fcd97aa981e727b0a5f6e7d750a0ed51fb0aaf0653ef14af30018"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "一", "para": 3, "chars": 68, "head": "我们所能掌控之事，其本质", "tail": "的，并且终究是身外之物。", "sha256": "a9c833ee83e8bc61636104d180229a0613c6cb46f242c3e82f06b8cdd3646705"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "一", "para": 4, "chars": 177, "head": "因此，你须牢记：倘若你将", "tail": "亦无任何事物能再伤害你。", "sha256": "cec06d5f94c64d3da54db0d2dbc7d32023903f0590222167bed94a9e5b412990"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二", "para": 0, "chars": 130, "head": "既然你的目标如此宏大，就", "tail": "能带来自由与幸福的前者。", "sha256": "77e701f0ea4f5e1907730f1477d026016ef2bde9c9563f4c44efec8b81a8d101"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三", "para": 0, "chars": 138, "head": "从此刻起，当你面对任何看", "tail": "诉自己：“这与我无关。”", "sha256": "a5ee90abc62902a012b12b66f1236983ee585d1c61b6004a90f762a1007cd063"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四", "para": 0, "chars": 113, "head": "欲望所求，在于获得其所欲", "tail": "死亡或贫穷，你终将不幸。", "sha256": "33bdcff561ebd722cea6b567c2d2d8446fa6aff69e136ef183b1b680e7b76618"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四", "para": 1, "chars": 149, "head": "所以，请将你的厌恶之心从", "tail": "从容不迫，不带任何偏执。", "sha256": "cc5542aec5ddc90bbad7dd948d47eebe12ae70e6da61fc6b6e187ab6434a9acd"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "五", "para": 0, "chars": 128, "head": "真正困扰人们的，并非事物", "tail": "，也就是我们自己的判断。", "sha256": "f2e21bfc0ccd16faa2975fcf1d17b9e26d1b10905d9189a1cc51c32609b0aa49"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "五", "para": 1, "chars": 66, "head": "无知之人的表现，是当事情", "tail": "于他人，也不归咎于自己。", "sha256": "d3d23ae5d72a0adf1e8259fd716cd37d299f2d62d03cfb5d37c87616fba9656a"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "六", "para": 0, "chars": 155, "head": "莫因任何身外之物的优越而", "tail": "是真正属于你自己的美德。", "sha256": "b5c8b7fb5829e2650024a126d7e45fb964a1865c3764c3e41d16b5aa515ae05d"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "七", "para": 0, "chars": 84, "head": "如同在航行中，船只抛锚停", "tail": "上，以免被捆绑着扔上船。", "sha256": "2adcd1713ebe3c4715a4017540b8227552d65d6628d93fc3988dc034b3b9b6bf"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "七", "para": 1, "chars": 100, "head": "人生亦是如此。倘若命运赐", "tail": "召唤时，你无法及时赶到。", "sha256": "2967c8daae55c657b694a41a20554bfed2d1acd41e8ef03af180659dd76d5692"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "八", "para": 0, "chars": 30, "head": "莫求事事如己愿，但愿事事", "tail": "，你的人生便会一帆风顺。", "sha256": "5def4a2daf1af863b3f0b74ee4d95870994b072469f6d0a83e8675e29ba04d2f"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "九", "para": 0, "chars": 91, "head": "疾病是身体的障碍，而非心", "tail": "但绝不会是你自身的障碍。", "sha256": "ba191cb7ad86b0eb57621e7739df0c9ed5f84c4f43d77aa8cd876a2bec9bbf0d"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十", "para": 0, "chars": 104, "head": "对于发生的每一件事，你都", "tail": "你会发现“忍耐”的力量。", "sha256": "f6b7feccd94900b6a6b3a2e9b41f64e168ca2a57acf22f519a5cc6228627dd22"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十", "para": 1, "chars": 28, "head": "当你养成这样的习惯，你便", "tail": "事物的表象所迷惑和主宰。", "sha256": "f0750ae3950dc88b51434f11ec05ab754e1e2406fcbbc425746b12f87a2be861"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十一", "para": 0, "chars": 77, "head": "永远不要说“我失去了一样", "tail": "了吗？那同样也被归还了。", "sha256": "91df277b70ed4f2f0d3a1d5d00eb5978af5f34c92c4f7ff402e76c3c7456a279"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十一", "para": 1, "chars": 96, "head": "你或许会说：“但夺走它的", "tail": "视它们，但不要视为己有。", "sha256": "1b8ae955a6f4df6fcfde64a02d22b8d13ef76681168a088dcf0c0426c67831ca"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十二", "para": 0, "chars": 102, "head": "若想精进，就必须摒弃诸如", "tail": "端，胜过你内心不得安宁。", "sha256": "4fd997eafd05c6b9b0969f5c88bcf28e73934ce7aa817b39aba6a8d10ea9d659"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十二", "para": 1, "chars": 113, "head": "从身边的小事做起。油洒了", "tail": "让他有能力搅乱你的心境。", "sha256": "cb2160765c1d368ed5d8ae7a8cdcbe36d96e157a17514be826a8e4863a9f3fe9"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十三", "para": 0, "chars": 130, "head": "若想精进，即便在关乎己身", "tail": "的同时，必然会忽略其二。", "sha256": "e5938a1b15a9b3c0d19cdb1ac118157258363d45bd18a5999e6abde4905291d2"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十四", "para": 0, "chars": 124, "head": "你若希望你的子女、妻子和", "tail": "空，这却是你力所能及的。", "sha256": "f27c52e8a7ea2d0479377260e375d001317f027a1d6156684878807eac2f7423"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十四", "para": 1, "chars": 17, "head": "因此，去修炼那些你力所能", "tail": "炼那些你力所能及之事吧。", "sha256": "da4fb348f21964ce14189ebb8ee6f50e58f737cd3d47f67cf82d65b1da9faf2a"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十四", "para": 2, "chars": 77, "head": "一个人真正的主人，是那个", "tail": "否则，他就注定是个奴隶。", "sha256": "179cbd0a97410b602312f71ee6925443664584e53fcee71519274149e3681702"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十五", "para": 0, "chars": 78, "head": "要记住，你当如赴宴一般处", "tail": "望投向远方，且耐心等待。", "sha256": "f98e170acd5484e4acf18fbe428fd2a31f6a8b3633e4077459dccb27b3c4341e"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十五", "para": 1, "chars": 127, "head": "对待子女、妻子、职位、财", "tail": "之无愧地被称为神圣之人。", "sha256": "67d3a16d5faca509138c5b1591ff9fb758425598f355c7eb60aaa2dd725772fd"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十六", "para": 0, "chars": 116, "head": "当你看到有人哀哭，或因孩", "tail": "而是他对这件事的看法。”", "sha256": "1ed3aa37d7cb05938c46fcc785f7abd6c8586e1107618d73217ec2a1f741c076"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十六", "para": 1, "chars": 46, "head": "尽管如此，在言语上，不妨", "tail": "莫让你的内心也随之叹息。", "sha256": "1a839997b388590c2170c9fc86c756a9b23360e2f6ef25247696cdd69448f2c3"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十七", "para": 0, "chars": 92, "head": "记住，你是在一出戏中扮演", "tail": "、官员或平民，亦复如是。", "sha256": "aa95bbda35ce18f220844675d3c54f24215ba0fe6df6d2900020c38e986c86c9"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十七", "para": 1, "chars": 32, "head": "你的天职，是演好分配给你", "tail": "哪个角色，那是他人的事。", "sha256": "3f4e367200a1026027eb8389840248b97ff5defdd85e8deb18da5755515dc3a0"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十八", "para": 0, "chars": 112, "head": "当一只乌鸦发出不祥的叫声", "tail": "，我皆有能力从中获益。”", "sha256": "4b4dd94c66694ade78b76c4e41f6835abc5baa8fab6297d319c9983f48999f79"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十九", "para": 0, "chars": 26, "head": "你不可能不败，除非你从不", "tail": "任何非你力所能及的竞争。", "sha256": "0aff7b682bf6970ffdbab590a530d59af3fc11274150e01fe6d1ebdabfa55c73"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十九", "para": 1, "chars": 112, "head": "当你看到某人地位尊崇、权", "tail": "只渴望成为一个自由的人。", "sha256": "4bbd665aed1faec9c3ee702577cf28514c946fa912b1d3157d394932549e55a7"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "十九", "para": 2, "chars": 27, "head": "通往这条道路的唯一方法，", "tail": "视那些非我力所能及之事。", "sha256": "6ffd73e4ba39189aec50485c8bd1d396426c082984abe155245120434d68a01b"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十", "para": 0, "chars": 117, "head": "切记，真正侮辱你的，不是", "tail": "你便能更容易地掌控自己。", "sha256": "9b65835444cf5f35c43d3975a0c631fefe0f827f32828fd2245a49f0de5206e4"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十一", "para": 0, "chars": 59, "head": "让死亡与流放，以及一切看", "tail": "亦不会过度贪求任何事物。", "sha256": "98b6a589d71f0f74f10925abcffdfdecc08b78a172998428a11f3322fef6e141"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十二", "para": 0, "chars": 66, "head": "你若向往哲学，就当从此刻", "tail": "的神气是从哪里学来的？”", "sha256": "c5273eea29d4480fe1edd16f2a03b9f6ac7d009bbb764c92bba5b0c11c55f783"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十二", "para": 1, "chars": 99, "head": "然而，你无需摆出高傲的神", "tail": "摇，便会招致双重的讥笑。", "sha256": "00c1e433d6cfddf4f2ad6644c963e88169fa32dbd5242a840ebe42484cda5621"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十三", "para": 0, "chars": 81, "head": "倘若你偶然转向身外之物，", "tail": "自己呈现，如此便已足够。", "sha256": "80d53d887462f3b9670f42ae581559b512cdb95f87663765cf58450aa43e5b41"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十四", "para": 0, "chars": 116, "head": "不要被这些念头所困扰：“", "tail": "又何谈是“毫无地位”呢？", "sha256": "1cb607c739dde5cbb601efee8d280e294a7834b5c244bc67e7cac53a29d50f1b"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十四", "para": 1, "chars": 35, "head": "你只应在你力所能及之事上", "tail": "你可以成为最有价值的人。", "sha256": "02b42956485779e007fde5f03856f9b4faf06f695089784eb88d95cada8e5298"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十四", "para": 2, "chars": 24, "head": "但你也许会说：“如此，我", "tail": "将无法帮助我的朋友们。”", "sha256": "c31a228af05a26ef2719ebdf39f8aa4e92f0a6846782a2be3c86c99956bd2d03"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十四", "para": 3, "chars": 80, "head": "此话何意？难道你的意思是", "tail": "他人自己所没有的东西呢？", "sha256": "f7c6fb79dcd82d00c7ef294f475bbb2695cfcd0ef938390b5d1d2d0610664bb5"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十四", "para": 4, "chars": 28, "head": "“那么，去挣钱吧，”他们", "tail": "这样我们也能分一杯羹。”", "sha256": "dc2c23819c855f711c46f762844060a35a13ec72cff29cce15b45a26a9611e77"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十四", "para": 5, "chars": 137, "head": "如果我能在保持我的自尊、", "tail": "会使我丧失这些品德的事。", "sha256": "d6bdc9a869af1bd30975c0c0a8b3b700cb0bcb57000d62c54f922d75a00af2df"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十四", "para": 6, "chars": 24, "head": "“可是，”你又会说，“我", "tail": "将无法为我的城邦效力。”", "sha256": "3924c54b6e13ba88e77607bd1a26ef11d545a9924c53dc6baea3e34f34ac41d6"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十四", "para": 7, "chars": 96, "head": "这又是指什么？你不能再为", "tail": "，难道你对它毫无贡献吗？", "sha256": "e76f9e8174ffdd6778a14b6514b318857cd39541701cda6e9c6829de8ff3475d"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十四", "para": 8, "chars": 17, "head": "“是的，但我在城邦中将毫", "tail": "我在城邦中将毫无地位。”", "sha256": "f264c942897341cafa074a360e6a5d52f2388ec5ea611ac1eb6a6e9183e7fe78"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十四", "para": 9, "chars": 64, "head": "那又如何？你不必成为执政", "tail": "你的所作所为，并非无用。", "sha256": "e2f101cbc39c13462169fa0c70e829a4a77f14b532515312af38e8fbc0419520"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十四", "para": 10, "chars": 21, "head": "“那么，”你问，“我在城", "tail": "我在城邦中将居于何位？”", "sha256": "29116858ecd2e635854cc4d8e2ad9fe3f0e0a3900aec733d21325ff90a860359"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十四", "para": 11, "chars": 73, "head": "答案是：任何你能胜任的、", "tail": "献”，最终又有何益处呢？", "sha256": "d9ef2cd1999c1848e21e51c433fb38bd4afd9ac5f8dd398ef4e58ec5093e6622"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十五", "para": 0, "chars": 37, "head": "在宴会上，某人是否比你更", "tail": "，或他的建议更常被采纳？", "sha256": "e96bd6eb61f255b9b7cfb56968477b57b7d62779b573c68e3d76eec5b0ee1164"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十五", "para": 1, "chars": 48, "head": "如果这些事是“善”的，那", "tail": "你没有得到，也不必烦恼。", "sha256": "ccec991dffea94ffbf01eb39d8189a8a9dfae2732f00ed9212b71a4f97c3adf8"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十五", "para": 2, "chars": 113, "head": "请记住，若你不像他人那样", "tail": "，那你就是贪婪且愚蠢的。", "sha256": "a4a1a14ca16ed0ed056dead6e7ce3c6639eb7a8d7cbd43037217279af990dbd3"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十五", "para": 3, "chars": 78, "head": "那么，一盘生菜的价钱是多", "tail": "有你未曾付出的那枚小钱。", "sha256": "a751713182da8d3ca5e83af6cb202bc5d5b3ca6fd29c6a6108d5a7e3ac4001ee"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十五", "para": 4, "chars": 103, "head": "事事皆然。你未被某人邀请", "tail": "就是贪得无厌、愚不可及。", "sha256": "c028bd45041de74e15a95639bb04c173f99b13d107d74f01a52b1bd2152ff110"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十五", "para": 5, "chars": 50, "head": "除了宴请，你难道一无所获", "tail": "于忍受他门前仆人的傲慢。", "sha256": "46632f6cd577329524972ec2f8ac085e2ba94068b6167ab45af3208029a2e702"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十六", "para": 0, "chars": 87, "head": "我们能够领会自然的意志，", "tail": "你也应当保持同样的心态。", "sha256": "b195097eb56085b56794ab2bfdd36b682fd0dc2ed2e44032699e80eefc6c2257"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十六", "para": 1, "chars": 95, "head": "将此理推而广之。当邻家的", "tail": "时，我们的感受是怎样的。", "sha256": "8fb3c6edae899cf3dc24a541cd1021cb19777505c2f208b866a46cbd53a8a087"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十七", "para": 0, "chars": 30, "head": "正如设立一个靶子不是为了", "tail": "间亦不存在本性为恶之物。", "sha256": "dfa22ef19345b93a01551fe325dc5211e950efac4fa814bf029059066feb27ee"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十八", "para": 0, "chars": 81, "head": "倘若有人将你的身体交由任", "tail": "时，你难道不感到羞愧吗？", "sha256": "c24120aca0b72586f024da05e527cce05ac8388bb3e6648c34828b50ee58d4db"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十九", "para": 0, "chars": 65, "head": "在采取任何行动之前，先审", "tail": "途而废，落得可耻的下场。", "sha256": "f27863456e24f452ce9fbbeaefd71b339047c9f28f27f230cdaf977caf19b407"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十九", "para": 1, "chars": 203, "head": "你渴望在奥林匹克运动会上", "tail": "后，你还可能会输掉比赛。", "sha256": "bf985d231451392402095de947a5cd9a3464fadd56f90a7baf00696470d005de"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十九", "para": 2, "chars": 132, "head": "深思熟虑之后，若你仍决心", "tail": "行事，而总是轻率、冲动。", "sha256": "32104cd768434e6eee1b334febbfed9942f12dd53e24391195a9e46cfc9139ba"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十九", "para": 3, "chars": 54, "head": "同理，有些人看过哲学家演", "tail": "），便也想成为一名哲人。", "sha256": "b1a1f784b0af9b1e733317181dbae62046e5c4d138acd1f4dbbd2accd688a561"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十九", "para": 4, "chars": 80, "head": "朋友，请先仔细审视这件事", "tail": "的腰身。因为人各有所长。", "sha256": "22a04677867145429b28f74aa63ebe8c45f8d80e84de0dfc58a3bed338788a93"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十九", "para": 5, "chars": 98, "head": "你以为在追求哲学的同时，", "tail": "庭上的诉讼，都屈居人下。", "sha256": "7a6e002f0b5ffafab9062e311a7a02da31c6acd1b3ced1ec26c5a738482a7bd5"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "二十九", "para": 6, "chars": 182, "head": "请全面权衡这些代价。你是", "tail": "一个贤者，或是一个俗人。", "sha256": "2e887f5dc7fd04c905f9d9675becad19cd5e7009f46ff4cd3c0bff0d9f4be7f3"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十", "para": 0, "chars": 56, "head": "责任，大体上是由社会关系", "tail": "他，忍受他的责备与管教。", "sha256": "b5c9ff23c1be47f5ec1c38e50e227c1d22e3a1304125b568fb9090582c197708"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十", "para": 1, "chars": 10, "head": "“但他是个坏父亲。”", "tail": "“但他是个坏父亲。”", "sha256": "f04be014b4721b0578708d66f06a4a9a078a774ca27f88c357c804f4c2efe8a5"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十", "para": 2, "chars": 122, "head": "难道自然法则规定你必须与", "tail": "害时，才会真的受到伤害。", "sha256": "c0dd168c0a4a9b3d12dcdbc451829af60a08b0d7484598c2f7a5cddd3d106214"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十", "para": 3, "chars": 35, "head": "同理，通过审视你与邻居、", "tail": "就能发现自己应尽的责任。", "sha256": "e781db94949d406aabc62671b22a1450df393899cfc074d469ae53c1dbb76476"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十一", "para": 0, "chars": 115, "head": "你要明白，敬神的首要原则", "tail": "会指责他们对你有所疏忽。", "sha256": "b1bac8dbdfb83b321e2983cab93586cee07653f0c8062a017768b86c97158210"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十一", "para": 1, "chars": 127, "head": "然而，要做到这一点，唯一", "tail": "抱怨和憎恨那些始作俑者。", "sha256": "6f2d68236841d4084343d955ea4b82749100efa71241c4bd4740edaac549788f"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十一", "para": 2, "chars": 100, "head": "因为，每一种生灵的天性，", "tail": "不可能喜爱伤害本身一样。", "sha256": "7b7771d8a5c563909f0eb384bfd38c6e0ea8cdcda5746019f9644dda313f6e34"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十一", "para": 3, "chars": 111, "head": "因此，儿子会抱怨父亲不把", "tail": "与他们的利益联系在一起。", "sha256": "002cdd6faaec13b74ccf47940f112c421b70228762a3f50322e93c0517738dc5"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十一", "para": 4, "chars": 85, "head": "所以，凡是能正确地校正自", "tail": "吝啬，不逾矩，恰如其分。", "sha256": "b89d8c030880455ebfd56b983712dccd3843b3c8c0889ba852d0c90ea9b2b544"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十二", "para": 0, "chars": 86, "head": "当你求助于占卜时，请记住", "tail": "因为，它既非善，亦非恶。", "sha256": "25defa9c1068b84d7a5cb3d3d3491a936a4968bb26a4f2aad49a814922a24065"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十二", "para": 1, "chars": 80, "head": "所以，当你去占卜时，不要", "tail": "恶。你无法改变或规避它。", "sha256": "38fa7b5e96d1112edee4c8a7f20057e4bd8f172f1a216eefc1edeea975595ab5"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十二", "para": 2, "chars": 204, "head": "因此，我们应像苏格拉底所", "tail": "出援手的人，逐出了神庙。", "sha256": "a11445d5c030d3d162e3e4f07eee527bb635bb3b629a9a974faac4da6e6a7a4b"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十三", "para": 0, "chars": 38, "head": "为自己设定一个明确的行为", "tail": "与人交往，都应恪守不渝。", "sha256": "e3a8e433db221e01be26266997104855f7c802311e2bb69dd6a4daeb899c5c65"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十三", "para": 1, "chars": 88, "head": "通常，保持沉默，或只说必", "tail": "不要议论他人的是非长短。", "sha256": "be783421490a81b8ce0bdc5b7eded6c32e14831624c68f3c90aa24befa965a20"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十三", "para": 2, "chars": 44, "head": "如果可能，通过你的言谈，", "tail": "陷俗人之中，就保持沉默。", "sha256": "94afc8c5edcced49da3307aba0e2d6dab2cf58d1f535bd245177c022a9428cd7"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十三", "para": 3, "chars": 20, "head": "不要放声大笑，也不要笑得", "tail": "不要笑得过于频繁或失控。", "sha256": "6d87d26196a95f4b87782679285e6e8a4bea5dc21bee46f8953fc4905bab7ca5"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十三", "para": 4, "chars": 30, "head": "如果可能，完全戒除对神明", "tail": "。若做不到，则尽力而为。", "sha256": "bc1fca12cca94094a5e92a9aaf01898407980e97a359ab84d4f4e6c11b78351a"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十三", "para": 5, "chars": 84, "head": "避免参加通俗的、公开的娱", "tail": "与他交往时，也会被玷污。", "sha256": "252d14baf93d55dc7823200656207503c24138ad70a722a5da5bad8a597be985"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十三", "para": 6, "chars": 46, "head": "只取用身体所需的基本物品", "tail": "耀与奢侈之物，都应摒弃。", "sha256": "9c268eb4abbb5f87f030f7159258b4c2bfacf6a51f4794caf6cc069df9ac6494"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十三", "para": 7, "chars": 63, "head": "在婚姻之事上，尽可能在婚", "tail": "，也不要夸耀自己的节制。", "sha256": "8f9067a488d89c24db4687531f88e4c8497308abb208833326c977786951d0f5"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十三", "para": 8, "chars": 60, "head": "若有人告诉你，某某在背后", "tail": "点，否则他会说得更多。”", "sha256": "fea1422b0a8b26b357180bea1500279a1410afc66370f68bf527f1bd208d8d7b"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十三", "para": 9, "chars": 118, "head": "不必频繁出入公共剧场。但", "tail": "为那对你的精进毫无裨益。", "sha256": "bed67147347c39dad2fe487b69f80c4c854bef5b532749db177fe5eb00d95a69"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十三", "para": 10, "chars": 43, "head": "不要轻率或冒然地去听某些", "tail": "，同时避免让人感到不快。", "sha256": "8ff14d30883e1c69e2400f5f44268368ed1d03c57a7b4d1e041134ba4b0a4ffd"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十三", "para": 11, "chars": 62, "head": "当你与人交往，特别是与那", "tail": "从容得体地应对任何场合。", "sha256": "bddfcd8d8790ef4a1911403398c4cf1354d45be69f5e44a8cc93d38fcadc7e9c"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十三", "para": 12, "chars": 98, "head": "当你去拜访权贵时，要预想", "tail": "想法，会被身外之物所困。", "sha256": "33f5f3cad8f23a565973dc5b7b82acace91e97f90984014a9784ac19a653ed41"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十三", "para": 13, "chars": 50, "head": "在与人交谈时，避免过多地", "tail": "危险，他人听来未必有趣。", "sha256": "4ea0688f3f1d8f866784b3efe70f383127d7c4798a50426c0643db095af6ecbc"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十三", "para": 14, "chars": 41, "head": "也不要试图去逗乐别人。因", "tail": "也会减损朋友对你的敬意。", "sha256": "121cff861a97063471dabcae25743621b3cdfa908e7353b6c05186ab12e81513"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十三", "para": 15, "chars": 69, "head": "谈论污言秽语是危险的。当", "tail": "表明你对这种言谈的厌恶。", "sha256": "848ddcf2094b212206256727649b54ff28172300c9d5e5b140c2790c14689312"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十四", "para": 0, "chars": 121, "head": "当你被某种感官享乐的表象", "tail": "你将体验到的喜悦与自得。", "sha256": "5adc21e0ab6602cf2292bfac7bce6a96e5daad6cf2da777f1ed94db60a3a2469"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十四", "para": 1, "chars": 66, "head": "若你认为时机成熟，可以放", "tail": "来的自觉，是何等的美好。", "sha256": "3fc7819d79fb5d12e6e695973d518166f39ef05981b4535620eba94aacf9df64"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十五", "para": 0, "chars": 90, "head": "当你明确知道一件事应做，", "tail": "又何惧那些无端的指责呢？", "sha256": "1504491ec54804757abd8bb61dbc4a37e034daceb415c051a1af8e4d9ecc356a"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十六", "para": 0, "chars": 106, "head": "“白天”和“夜晚”这两个", "tail": "，更要顾及对主人的尊重。", "sha256": "fb51bc3f3b47cbf95bfd157c8e7b2469556307c7c80225d16d297da6e69be711"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十七", "para": 0, "chars": 42, "head": "你若扮演一个超出你能力范", "tail": "那个你本可以胜任的角色。", "sha256": "226757fb45f6c93c3dd95dd5c2e8f563844a12163a755d15d17d61a5c0993871"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十八", "para": 0, "chars": 89, "head": "正如你在行走时，小心翼翼", "tail": "我们的行动将会更加稳妥。", "sha256": "3fc8b3b3fde2b1f81a026fa50dc60150a6072a4712d5e3b2694c898831c74ab4"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "三十九", "para": 0, "chars": 131, "head": "每个人的身体，都是其财产", "tail": "自然的尺度，便再无止境。", "sha256": "6d35eb8635265fa0bcb0d49fb753a5888213251e5a310726c688fe183f62bec1"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十", "para": 0, "chars": 104, "head": "女子在年满十四岁后，便被", "tail": "她们的端庄、谦逊与贞洁。", "sha256": "5ffce555d2e5851d884c38737ba2ada0922d885d9d625031d245d4dd99af1bce"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十一", "para": 0, "chars": 66, "head": "一个人若反复思虑身体之事", "tail": "神，都应专注于你的心智。", "sha256": "097c629561e34a54a66d7863c7c4e0e430bb504762ee4778e7be5053ba674f6c"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十二", "para": 0, "chars": 150, "head": "当有人对你恶语相向或行为", "tail": "本身，而是那个误判的人。", "sha256": "0b1bb91146b28710aba9e1d9e8d64d203df3c77c7b0fac0dc18b71d80c5c9165"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十二", "para": 1, "chars": 53, "head": "以此为出发点，你便能温和", "tail": "“在他看来，这是对的。”", "sha256": "e50bebcaf6e6fbd5e8571d624483cd33b495d64b2bab196285ccfdf412b6fb47"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十三", "para": 0, "chars": 111, "head": "任何事物都有两面，一面可", "tail": "便能以正确的方式来承受。", "sha256": "afaaee667e8f9c197545f700261acebd4dea6bc89b8ada1337be0db084952f4d"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十四", "para": 0, "chars": 45, "head": "以下这些推论是错误的：“", "tail": "善辩，所以我比你优越。”", "sha256": "e420b0b8db8ff77c42cb39310c60781bef4fd17c7eb1f714349839d53d0dae62"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十四", "para": 1, "chars": 50, "head": "更正确的推论是：“我比你", "tail": "我的言辞比你的更精彩。”", "sha256": "5100d8999091ad1ac36b4df13554e3cdc29e6a9285560b34a0f406b1aa4b44f3"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十四", "para": 2, "chars": 15, "head": "但你本人，既非财产，亦非", "tail": "人，既非财产，亦非言辞。", "sha256": "5e3c20b69c11628ecc9d9f47819a0d26619961d33e7b24f47243360cde222ccb"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十五", "para": 0, "chars": 87, "head": "有人洗澡很快。不要说他洗", "tail": "他的行为是“不好”的呢？", "sha256": "3062cac179086768275f232e74915f4cae3b0cb2f596949b0033dcc912a0d57c"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十五", "para": 1, "chars": 30, "head": "如此，你便不会因为只看到", "tail": "，而对其做出错误的评判。", "sha256": "f044c7acfca99d46fd29d7b1fb134953a81c8e1d9df4d9691b138fc5838382a9"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十六", "para": 0, "chars": 136, "head": "在任何场合，都不要自称为", "tail": "自己被如此轻视毫不在意。", "sha256": "94644551c87c825b8c5d167a4192b8d6db58d7ccc6ab8a7ce58f89028212fae6"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十六", "para": 1, "chars": 132, "head": "若在俗人中，偶然谈及某个", "tail": "，在体外产出羊毛与羊奶。", "sha256": "ad093a347f87f5bdfb32cedb1470ad8a0a585dc06ae16041e2f60749870d2169"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十六", "para": 2, "chars": 37, "head": "所以，你也不要在俗人面前", "tail": "化它们之后所产生的行动。", "sha256": "aa6b509901e232ef154a36dfc07c69d562d2461355937edf1e03935406a562cb"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十七", "para": 0, "chars": 95, "head": "当你能以简朴的方式满足身", "tail": "后吐掉，不要告诉任何人。", "sha256": "108286b8d8a1a695d17a5fc2e6468a934671647d05d52769c0adb462cb1f7709"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十八", "para": 0, "chars": 32, "head": "俗人的标志是：他从不指望", "tail": "伤害，而总是求助于外物。", "sha256": "d7fe7ea3742d5a0fdbf9466c3e62ebadc0f7431b423ab442fadd9db23e04e042"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十八", "para": 1, "chars": 24, "head": "哲人的标志是：他的一切助", "tail": "益或伤害，都求诸于自身。", "sha256": "4a6b2b88cf229d187ebdee94fa07918fcf0a960d28a7f1b191608c98f8603517"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十八", "para": 2, "chars": 135, "head": "修行精进之人的标志是：他", "tail": "完全康复前，有任何闪失。", "sha256": "4c8766dfc27f5295c15ab7ee6413e60a459f54f5ea2405e928b8333461bcad6b"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十八", "para": 3, "chars": 93, "head": "他摒弃了一切欲望，将厌恶", "tail": "人一样，时刻警惕着自己。", "sha256": "9aa096e93cda37c82aecb7da2ef4f6af36e836b334765f37324c3ca86f05e75f"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十九", "para": 0, "chars": 61, "head": "当有人因理解并能阐释克律", "tail": "人还有什么可夸耀的呢？”", "sha256": "7bfeae88f2f2c8e656eba47bd3ce63bea71df072bca2a1fe5b7d89fde6d10ee6"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十九", "para": 1, "chars": 93, "head": "而我追求的是什么？是理解", "tail": "所作所为并无可夸耀之处。", "sha256": "16b4efbec0aac2d18181e5ee4ed17dab2ce0a106e36c2fdc7df0d98e44be73df"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十九", "para": 2, "chars": 96, "head": "当我找到了解释者，我还需", "tail": "的是克律西波，而非荷马。", "sha256": "e841755f43aca03d211e119baf2830c2d4046b38662f8954cf954bd117674e8e"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "四十九", "para": 3, "chars": 63, "head": "所以，当有人对我说“请为", "tail": "因为无法做到而面红耳赤。", "sha256": "4e8b31b8ba3455732e62f547c6941638c889079d1a3812594400cfaffccaeb71"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "五十", "para": 0, "chars": 62, "head": "无论你确立了何种信条，都", "tail": "为那已非你力所能及之事。", "sha256": "1a2d874b2eb87af0478434b53e2584b75ef71d4803367dc581e7af225a8f2f1e"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "五十一", "para": 0, "chars": 75, "head": "你还要等待多久，才肯将自", "tail": "改进的责任推到他身上呢？", "sha256": "3834b92310678415e1a623aee832f52bc9c4b968a9151d67bdfdb433ffc1d810"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "五十一", "para": 1, "chars": 75, "head": "你已不再是孩童，而是顶天", "tail": "成，并至死都是一个俗人。", "sha256": "b3a533e892fce3647530cee54c0083ba086e0bb86bd06a9dd487a68ead62fe25"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "五十一", "para": 2, "chars": 127, "head": "所以，从现在起，就下定决", "tail": "于这一天、这一刻的行动。", "sha256": "950905fdf3776be9058818ddda86201abf8fd07c70c1da1721fb0b0525f77b9c"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "五十一", "para": 3, "chars": 66, "head": "苏格拉底正是这样成为完人", "tail": "为苏格拉底的人那样生活。", "sha256": "b530f385267d0a44f265e3ef99ac060e0cb1ba65d64b7aa5ed3ef55dbb3994b7"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "五十二", "para": 0, "chars": 118, "head": "哲学的第一步，也是最重要", "tail": "么是真理？什么是谬误？”", "sha256": "562fa10cf12c8d71447cc4f47675f54a294d9c2711f0fe8caa18fbeb211ad7b3"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "五十二", "para": 1, "chars": 80, "head": "因此，第三步是为第二步服", "tail": "此，却完全忽略了第一步。", "sha256": "fe1411240bdb9b6c54ac3e27c32f0919eade8bae9821c72d317ff5bb77585708"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "五十二", "para": 2, "chars": 29, "head": "结果便是，我们虽然能巧妙", "tail": "不该撒谎，却依然在撒谎。", "sha256": "fe3ed9e304dee8a8e4fb7374695a3bb87a39a252acfc76f35457a3737c7cde80"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "五十三", "para": 0, "chars": 16, "head": "在任何场合，我们都应准备", "tail": "合，我们都应准备好说出：", "sha256": "e2235359450720d58fa203ec3bddeae90b7e1fb2a968ba9073ff7b6386e8078b"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "五十三", "para": 1, "chars": 32, "head": "“引领我吧，哦，宙斯，还", "tail": "无论你们为我指派何方。”", "sha256": "7fed88a8aac2d1f28ae7a5e664439338b09ca3a1e1a3630a652c73dcdd0712c5"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "五十三", "para": 2, "chars": 35, "head": "“我将毫不犹豫地追随。即", "tail": "，我终究还是必须前往。”", "sha256": "f6e7242a191e5ed56c75cd10ff2e326e3f348365ffddc056e678ed2ecd3c8a82"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "五十三", "para": 3, "chars": 28, "head": "“凡能坦然顺应必然者，我", "tail": "智者，他通晓神圣之事。”", "sha256": "79480fcbfb0e4eb240dc0c2c162054b7e10c8a7ea1d6c3dd241e2b01452b73f4"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "五十三", "para": 4, "chars": 24, "head": "“哦，克里托，若这便是诸", "tail": "神的意愿，那便如此吧。”", "sha256": "4c6ff716d88e002f2d852cf1fec83642af7b0fbe0360aec18309325d33a20ced"}
{"kind": "src_para", "cand_heading": "五十三", "para": 5, "chars": 25, "head": "“阿尼图斯和美勒托可以杀", "tail": "我，但他们无法伤害我。”", "sha256": "e5722456c62b917c2db7905d450ba6621f15abc61b8931268a94693e94754e32"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 0, "title": "版本与来源说明", "role": "frontmatter_note", "source": "版本与来源说明(本站撰写)", "blocks": 6, "chars": 854, "head_block": "《手册》（Enchiridi", "tail_block": "方式共享时请一并保留本说明。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 1, "title": "第一节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选一+二+三(并回通行I)", "blocks": 7, "chars": 638, "head_block": "世间万物，皆可一分为二。其一", "tail_block": "地告诉自己：“这与我无关。”"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 2, "title": "第二节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选四", "blocks": 2, "chars": 262, "head_block": "欲望所求，在于获得其所欲之物", "tail_block": "”，从容不迫，不带任何偏执。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 3, "title": "第三节", "role": "new_translation_2026", "source": "本站补译(通行III/IV)", "blocks": 1, "chars": 143, "head_block": "凡令你愉悦、供你使用、或为你", "tail_block": "有一日离世，你便不至于烦乱。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 4, "title": "第四节", "role": "new_translation_2026", "source": "本站补译(通行III/IV)", "blocks": 1, "chars": 182, "head_block": "当你着手做任何一件事之前，先", "tail_block": "事所扰，我便做不到这一点。”"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 5, "title": "第五节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选五", "blocks": 2, "chars": 194, "head_block": "真正困扰人们的，并非事物本身", "tail_block": "归咎于他人，也不归咎于自己。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 6, "title": "第六节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选六", "blocks": 1, "chars": 155, "head_block": "莫因任何身外之物的优越而自鸣", "tail_block": "的，是真正属于你自己的美德。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 7, "title": "第七节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选七", "blocks": 2, "chars": 184, "head_block": "如同在航行中，船只抛锚停泊，", "tail_block": "船长召唤时，你无法及时赶到。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 8, "title": "第八节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选八", "blocks": 1, "chars": 30, "head_block": "莫求事事如己愿，但愿事事如其", "tail_block": "如此，你的人生便会一帆风顺。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 9, "title": "第九节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选九", "blocks": 1, "chars": 91, "head_block": "疾病是身体的障碍，而非心智的", "tail_block": "碍，但绝不会是你自身的障碍。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 10, "title": "第十节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选十", "blocks": 2, "chars": 132, "head_block": "对于发生的每一件事，你都应反", "tail_block": "再被事物的表象所迷惑和主宰。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 11, "title": "第十一节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选十一", "blocks": 2, "chars": 173, "head_block": "永远不要说“我失去了一样东西", "tail_block": "，珍视它们，但不要视为己有。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 12, "title": "第十二节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选十二", "blocks": 2, "chars": 215, "head_block": "若想精进，就必须摒弃诸如此类", "tail_block": "要到让他有能力搅乱你的心境。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 13, "title": "第十三节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选十三", "blocks": 1, "chars": 130, "head_block": "若想精进，即便在关乎己身的小", "tail_block": "其一的同时，必然会忽略其二。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 14, "title": "第十四节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选十四", "blocks": 3, "chars": 218, "head_block": "你若希望你的子女、妻子和朋友", "tail_block": "物。否则，他就注定是个奴隶。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 15, "title": "第十五节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选十五", "blocks": 2, "chars": 205, "head_block": "要记住，你当如赴宴一般处世。", "tail_block": "才当之无愧地被称为神圣之人。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 16, "title": "第十六节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选十六", "blocks": 2, "chars": 162, "head_block": "当你看到有人哀哭，或因孩子远", "tail_block": "，切莫让你的内心也随之叹息。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 17, "title": "第十七节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选十七", "blocks": 2, "chars": 124, "head_block": "记住，你是在一出戏中扮演角色", "tail_block": "挑选哪个角色，那是他人的事。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 18, "title": "第十八节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选十八", "blocks": 1, "chars": 112, "head_block": "当一只乌鸦发出不祥的叫声时，", "tail_block": "何事，我皆有能力从中获益。”"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 19, "title": "第十九节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选十九", "blocks": 3, "chars": 165, "head_block": "你不可能不败，除非你从不参与", "tail_block": "是轻视那些非我力所能及之事。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 20, "title": "第二十节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选二十", "blocks": 1, "chars": 117, "head_block": "切记，真正侮辱你的，不是那个", "tail_block": "机，你便能更容易地掌控自己。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 21, "title": "第二十一节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选二十一", "blocks": 1, "chars": 59, "head_block": "让死亡与流放，以及一切看似可", "tail_block": "念，亦不会过度贪求任何事物。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 22, "title": "第二十二节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选二十二", "blocks": 2, "chars": 165, "head_block": "你若向往哲学，就当从此刻起，", "tail_block": "所动摇，便会招致双重的讥笑。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 23, "title": "第二十三节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选二十三", "blocks": 1, "chars": 81, "head_block": "倘若你偶然转向身外之物，意图", "tail_block": "就向自己呈现，如此便已足够。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 24, "title": "第二十四节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选二十四", "blocks": 12, "chars": 715, "head_block": "不要被这些念头所困扰：“我将", "tail_block": "“贡献”，最终又有何益处呢？"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 25, "title": "第二十五节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选二十五", "blocks": 6, "chars": 429, "head_block": "在宴会上，某人是否比你更受优", "tail_block": "也免于忍受他门前仆人的傲慢。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 26, "title": "第二十六节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选二十六", "blocks": 2, "chars": 182, "head_block": "我们能够领会自然的意志，通常", "tail_block": "不幸时，我们的感受是怎样的。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 27, "title": "第二十七节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选二十七", "blocks": 1, "chars": 30, "head_block": "正如设立一个靶子不是为了让人", "tail_block": "，世间亦不存在本性为恶之物。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 28, "title": "第二十八节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选二十八", "blocks": 1, "chars": 81, "head_block": "倘若有人将你的身体交由任何一", "tail_block": "不安时，你难道不感到羞愧吗？"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 29, "title": "第二十九节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选二十九", "blocks": 7, "chars": 814, "head_block": "在采取任何行动之前，先审视其", "tail_block": "成为一个贤者，或是一个俗人。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 30, "title": "第三十节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选三十", "blocks": 4, "chars": 223, "head_block": "责任，大体上是由社会关系来界", "tail_block": "，你就能发现自己应尽的责任。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 31, "title": "第三十一节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选三十一", "blocks": 5, "chars": 538, "head_block": "你要明白，敬神的首要原则是持", "tail_block": "，不吝啬，不逾矩，恰如其分。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 32, "title": "第三十二节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选三十二", "blocks": 3, "chars": 370, "head_block": "当你求助于占卜时，请记住，你", "tail_block": "时伸出援手的人，逐出了神庙。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 33, "title": "第三十三节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选三十三", "blocks": 16, "chars": 954, "head_block": "为自己设定一个明确的行为准则", "tail_block": "，来表明你对这种言谈的厌恶。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 34, "title": "第三十四节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选三十四", "blocks": 2, "chars": 187, "head_block": "当你被某种感官享乐的表象所吸", "tail_block": "所带来的自觉，是何等的美好。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 35, "title": "第三十五节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选三十五", "blocks": 1, "chars": 90, "head_block": "当你明确知道一件事应做，并且", "tail_block": "，你又何惧那些无端的指责呢？"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 36, "title": "第三十六节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选三十六", "blocks": 1, "chars": 106, "head_block": "“白天”和“夜晚”这两个命题", "tail_block": "益处，更要顾及对主人的尊重。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 37, "title": "第三十七节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选三十七", "blocks": 1, "chars": 42, "head_block": "你若扮演一个超出你能力范围的", "tail_block": "错失那个你本可以胜任的角色。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 38, "title": "第三十八节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选三十八", "blocks": 1, "chars": 89, "head_block": "正如你在行走时，小心翼翼，生", "tail_block": "惕，我们的行动将会更加稳妥。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 39, "title": "第三十九节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选三十九", "blocks": 1, "chars": 131, "head_block": "每个人的身体，都是其财产的度", "tail_block": "越了自然的尺度，便再无止境。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 40, "title": "第四十节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选四十", "blocks": 1, "chars": 104, "head_block": "女子在年满十四岁后，便被男人", "tail_block": "，是她们的端庄、谦逊与贞洁。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 41, "title": "第四十一节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选四十一", "blocks": 1, "chars": 66, "head_block": "一个人若反复思虑身体之事，如", "tail_block": "部心神，都应专注于你的心智。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 42, "title": "第四十二节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选四十二", "blocks": 2, "chars": 203, "head_block": "当有人对你恶语相向或行为不端", "tail_block": "说：“在他看来，这是对的。”"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 43, "title": "第四十三节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选四十三", "blocks": 1, "chars": 111, "head_block": "任何事物都有两面，一面可以提", "tail_block": "，你便能以正确的方式来承受。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 44, "title": "第四十四节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选四十四", "blocks": 3, "chars": 110, "head_block": "以下这些推论是错误的：“我比", "tail_block": "你本人，既非财产，亦非言辞。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 45, "title": "第四十五节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选四十五", "blocks": 2, "chars": 117, "head_block": "有人洗澡很快。不要说他洗得“", "tail_block": "表象，而对其做出错误的评判。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 46, "title": "第四十六节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选四十六", "blocks": 3, "chars": 305, "head_block": "在任何场合，都不要自称为“哲", "tail_block": "你消化它们之后所产生的行动。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 47, "title": "第四十七节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选四十七", "blocks": 1, "chars": 95, "head_block": "当你能以简朴的方式满足身体所", "tail_block": "，然后吐掉，不要告诉任何人。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 48, "title": "第四十八节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选四十八", "blocks": 4, "chars": 284, "head_block": "俗人的标志是：他从不指望从自", "tail_block": "范敌人一样，时刻警惕着自己。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 49, "title": "第四十九节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选四十九", "blocks": 4, "chars": 313, "head_block": "当有人因理解并能阐释克律西波", "tail_block": "不是因为无法做到而面红耳赤。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 50, "title": "第五十节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选五十", "blocks": 1, "chars": 62, "head_block": "无论你确立了何种信条，都当像", "tail_block": "，因为那已非你力所能及之事。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 51, "title": "第五十一节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选五十一", "blocks": 4, "chars": 343, "head_block": "你还要等待多久，才肯将自己引", "tail_block": "望成为苏格拉底的人那样生活。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 52, "title": "第五十二节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选五十二", "blocks": 3, "chars": 227, "head_block": "哲学的第一步，也是最重要的一", "tail_block": "为何不该撒谎，却依然在撒谎。"}
{"kind": "target_chapter", "index": 53, "title": "第五十三节", "role": "goocarlos_translation", "source": "候选五十三", "blocks": 6, "chars": 160, "head_block": "在任何场合，我们都应准备好说", "tail_block": "杀死我，但他们无法伤害我。”"}
{"kind": "accounting", "src_paras_total": 141, "target_paras_from_src": 141, "balanced": true, "new_translation_paras": 2}
